{"data":[{"uuid":"2756f5f1-ef1e-454a-a171-9a5bd40e3a9d","name":"M4A Cannon","class_name":"BEHR_LaserCannon_S2","type":"WeaponGun","sub_type":"Gun","size":2,"grade":"A","class":null,"manufacturer":{"name":"Behring Applied Technology","code":"BEHR","uuid":"65a5d887-3b21-4046-a718-6912c0c7c3be","link":"https://api.star-citizen.wiki/api/manufacturers/BEHR"},"description":{"en_EN":"The M4A is Behring's second tier laser autocannon. Its bigger size means more power consumption in exchange for packing a bigger punch. Fire rate and power efficiency are comparable to the M3A model.","de_DE":"Hersteller: Behring\nTyp (En): Laser Cannon\nTyp (De): Laserkanone\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S2\n\nDie M4A ist Behrings Laser-Autokanone der zweiten Stufe. Durch ihre gr\u00f6\u00dfere Gr\u00f6\u00dfe steigt der Energieverbrauch im Austausch f\u00fcr eine st\u00e4rkere Wirkung. Schussrate und Energieeffizienz sind mit dem Modell M3A vergleichbar.","zh_CN":"\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1a\u8d1d\u6797\u8d22\u56e2\uff08Behring\uff09\n\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u6fc0\u5149\u52a0\u519c\u70ae\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a2\n\nM4A \u6fc0\u5149\u52a0\u519c\u70ae\u662f\u8d1d\u6797\u8d22\u56e2\u7684\u4e8c\u7ea7\u6fc0\u5149\u81ea\u52a8\u52a0\u519c\u70ae\u3002\u5b83\u66f4\u5927\u7684\u5c3a\u5bf8\u610f\u5473\u7740\u66f4\u591a\u7684\u529f\u8017\uff0c\u66f4\u5927\u7684\u5a01\u529b\u3002\u5c04\u901f\u548c\u80fd\u91cf\u6548\u7387\u4e0e M3A \u6fc0\u5149\u52a0\u519c\u70ae\u76f8\u5f53\u3002","fr_FR":"Type d'article : Canon laser\nFabricant : Behring\nTaille : 2\n\nLe M4A est l'autocanon laser de Behring de deuxi\u00e8me niveau. Sa taille plus grande entra\u00eene une consommation d'\u00e9nergie accrue en \u00e9change d'un coup plus puissant. La cadence de tir et l'efficacit\u00e9 \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique sont comparables \u00e0 celles du mod\u00e8le M3A."},"images":[{"source":"starcitizen.tools","original_url":"https://media.starcitizen.tools/5/5f/Behring_M4A.png?8smqi","thumbnail_url":"https://media.starcitizen.tools/thumb/5/5f